                "text": "Earlier today, my Democratic colleagues and I stood on the House steps to reaffirm our commitment to fighting for affordable health care. \n\nThe Republican funding bill does nothing to address soaring premiums. I will be voting NO. https://t.co/w5h0x0X0AT",
